  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "game/sched",
      "items": [
        "System{Name, Phase, Scope, Every, Offset, RunIf, Reads, Writes, After, Before, Ambiguous, Run}",
        "Ordered once by Kahn's algorithm over After/Before, ties by (phase rank, name); sched/testdata/order.golden pins the 27-row order",
        "A cycle, an unknown name or phase, a duplicate, or two same-phase systems sharing a store with no order fail construction"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "One Pass",
      "items": [
        "A system runs when (primary or PerMap) and (Every == 0 or (tick + Offset) % Every == 0) and RunIf holds",
        "Every map runs the PerMap systems; only the first map's pass runs the Colony ones",
        "The order shown is the run order; arrows to the lower lanes are taken only when a system is due"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Not yet",
      "items": [
        "Every system still declares Legacy reads and writes, so nothing runs in parallel between systems",
        "No event queue runs between systems: domain/sim/event is still an empty package",
        "The only parallel work is the path stage inside movement (see parallel-stage)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Evidence",
      "items": [
        "Sources pinned to commit fe0f8604c (local-only); 27 systems in 15 phases per order.golden",
        "Pass costs about 58 ns with 0 allocations (ARCH-009 ledger)"
      ]
    }
  ]
